WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.600
It began at a fair. Lanterns. Laughter. And one dangerous word: always.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.600
Then the sky opened. And something on the other side... heard you.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.500
Now the crack runs down the road. And home is counting on you.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.600
Choose your traveller. Take the road. Leave certainty behind.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.600
In Boolesbury... friendly faces. Strange promises. Who can you believe?

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:42.700
In Tomorrowton... a thousand voices shout. But which story can stand?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.500
And above it all... the Server Tower. Waiting.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:55.500
Test the rule. Question the claim. Find the flaw.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:02.700
Catch extraordinary creatures. Build your collection. Bring your best into the Card Arena.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:09.600
Outthink your rivals... when even the rules can turn against you.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.600
Something thinks it knows your next move. Will you prove it wrong?

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:20.600
Rift of Reason. Think before you shout.
